WEBVTT

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.990
Why would they seal the sanctum?

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.330
They want to figure out why His Majesty collapsed before opening it back up.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:23.920
How is His Majesty?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.980
He is recovering quickly.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.000
He will soon be able to sing again.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.750
But without His Majesty's voice, we can't hope to sustain the Starwind sector

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.300
or Sigur Valens's defensive barrier.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.010
If the enemy learns of this, it would be...

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.770
No one outside of the castle knows of what happened to His Majesty.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.050
All we need to do is keep them at bay until the sanctum is usable again.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.820
Your apple saplings have grown well.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.940
They sure have.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.660
I can move them to the farm at this point.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.990
I shall deliver them to your family in Exder.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:03.330
I'll bring hoes, braces, and fertilizer too.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.180
I appreciate it.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:11.780
Alec...

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:18.990
<i>Our kiss will link us from one end to the other</i>

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:23.420
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:28.270
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.070
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:47.590
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.210
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:57.090
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:00.940
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:07.910
<i>Our cores crash into each other, confirming our uncovered love</i>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:12.310
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:18.930
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:24.820
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:27.540
<i>Charm me with your passion, pray to the heavens</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.910
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.170
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:39.650
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.720
Alpha and Delta Platoons successfully loaded onto Aether.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.880
Commence transferring the Destroid unit to Hemera.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.480
What deal did you strike with that old jellyfish muncher?

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.250
We don't have any test results yet.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:05.740
He agreed to deploy the both of you on the condition that I take full responsibility.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.000
What if I lose control again?

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:15.960
If you put the team or civilians at risk, I will stop you even if I have to shoot you down.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.950
Mirage...

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.720
Fine.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.640
Not that I'd lose control again.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.100
I sure hope so.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.000
Welcome back, Fre-Fre.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.820
Your first show in a while and it's a battle.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:44.990
You're crazy, girl.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.370
Freyja!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.860
Just stick to the usual.

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.000
Right.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.350
Mikumo, you're good to go?

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.440
You don't have to worry about me.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.170
I'm me.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.670
I just sing.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:05.010
Although, that might just be how I was programmed.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.010
Kumo-Kumo!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:32.620
Please pardon my insolence the other day.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.640
Enough.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:38.410
However, I ask you to keep it a secret from others.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.500
And don't blame Roid for it.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.260
I asked for it.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.130
What do you want today?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.900
I doubt you just came to apologize.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.850
There is something I wish to ask you.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.310
There are a number of unexpected developments.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.400
What is your opinion on the matter?

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:03.280
Roid says it bears no significance.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.780
He has led Windermere well this far.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:14.210
He was Father's faithful servant and has supported me since my childhood.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:33.220
The wind Roid wakes should carry us safely.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.090
Is that your true wind?

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:46.530
The day you were born, His Majesty took me to Dragonbird Peak.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.490
I was born from a concubine and am no Wind Singer.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:56.500
He taught me how to fly the true wind.

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:01.750
The true wind blows in oneself.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:05.470
Everyone must find and ride it themselves.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:10.930
That was the last time he allowed me to call him Father.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.680
I am a knight of the wind.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.150
I am a sword at the disposal of Windermere's king.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.150
May your wind blow true.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.310
True wind...

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.600
Things are such a mess.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.770
But at least I can fly again.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.220
I should be grateful to the captain and Mirage.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.230
You sing, I fly.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.420
That's all there is to it for us.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.310
I'm jealous of how simpleminded you are.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.610
How nice of you.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.820
That might do for now, though.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.150
Right?

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.790
You've always confused me.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:18.990
My singing can calm the Var and resonate throughout the galaxy,

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:22.290
but you'd only react to Freyja's voice.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.470
I guess we're connected somehow.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.430
I see.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.130
You're doing pretty well for yourself.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:33.520
You connected to the Protoculture structures and all.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.520
It's pretty scary, you know.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:41.100
Oh, you can be afraid too?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.900
That's right.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.000
So you'd better protect me.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.490
I'm the youngest in Walküre.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:50.170
Roger.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:52.470
Man, I can't believe you're only three.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.320
Let's do this.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:06.590
The giant system won't work without me.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:08.960
Kumo-Kumo...

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.260
Regardless of my past, I am myself.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:15.970
Right now, my job is to sing.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.730
Mikumo!

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:22.390
Release docking arm from island jack pod.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.840
Commence transformation sequence.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.570
Reactor output normal.

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:28.860
Fold condensers all green.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:35.560
According to Mikumo, the Wind Singer isn't able to sing at the moment.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:36.280
Correct?

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:37.450
Yes.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:42.410
If we want to free the galaxy from Windermere, now is our chance.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:47.670
Chaos will now strike with all its force.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:51.630
We're up against the Protoculture's 
systems which we know very little of.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.920
Their forces also far outnumber us.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:58.570
But we can't just let them take over the galaxy.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:04.940
Ragnans say that seagulls that take 
jellyfish lightly get dragged into the sea.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.860
Let's show Windermere what we're made of.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.190
I have high expectations for you all.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.200
Macross Elysion, fold!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:34.790
Enter.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.340
Your Majesty, Randall is under attack.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:58.820
All units, fan out!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:02.030
Let them taste the wrath of Voldor army!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.820
Roger!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.980
I didn't expect to ever fight in you again.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.420
Fire!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.290
Good.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:18.880
They've arrived?

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.700
The enemy is a joint force of Chaos and Voldorians.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.080
They brought in a Macross-class?

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:49.370
Keith, Bogue, Hermann: depart with your platoons for Randall immediately.

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:55.000
Cassim, Theo, Xao: prepare air wings 1, 2, and 3 for deployment.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.440
Roger.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.100
Thanks, I owe you one!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.560
The Aerial Knights!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.750
Leave this to me, Sir White Knight!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.670
Follow me, fledglings!

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:23.160
Da!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:27.180
The wind is crying.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:32.040
Planet Alfheim

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.680
This is the Alfheim Defense Force.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.400
We are under enemy attack!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.500
The Delta Platoon.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.280
So Randall was a distraction?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:42.760
But what do they want on that useless planet?

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:47.720
This is...

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.940
Gamma and Theta Platoons are 
keeping the defense forces busy.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.000
Perfect.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.620
Get ready, Walküre!

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:57.630
Roger.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:01.400
Open a fold gate with your tactical show so we can infiltrate Windermere

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.370
and take out the core system of the Starwind sector.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.620
This might be a one-way ticket.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.080
Strap yourselves in!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:08.650
Roger!

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:09.330
Yes, sir!

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.040
Alfheim...

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:17.850
Messer...

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.220
Our songs will take us to Windermere.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:26.680
Perhaps he will guide us there.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.970
Let's do this, girls.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.640
We can't let this war draw out any longer.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.820
Yeah!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:43.780
<i>A drop of light in the overflowing darkness</i>

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:50.030
<i>A voice tired from a journey so long</i>

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:56.580
<i>The melody rises and with it miracles</i>

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:03.340
<i>break the dark gravity's chains</i>

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.340
The system's response?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:09.190
<i>Reality drives our borrowed winds to eternity</i>

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.460
No good.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.800
Freyja's bio-fold waves are unstable.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:16.210
<i>but that should serve for an answer, so hurry</i>

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.520
<i>Look up</i>

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:23.960
<i>If you fall, at least do it after it's all sorted out</i>

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.380
What are you even doing, Freyja?!

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.400
Sing properly!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.230
Hayate?

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:30.330
<i>Let the lyrics be your wings and take you high</i>

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:25.150
Freyja!

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:30.330
Freyja...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:36.830
<i>We can tackle any evil if we are together</i>

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.040
Fre-Fre...

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.580
She doesn't want me to lose control...

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.990
Freyja!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:45.500
<i>Just take the chance and make this the best song ever</i>

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.910
Mikumo...

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.890
Sing with all you've got, Freyja!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:52.100
Flying doesn't feel right without your song!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:57.140
But if I sing, that'll put you and Mirage at risk...

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.690
Believe in Hayate.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.310
Freyja!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:02.570
Freyja!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.690
Contact at 2 o'clock!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.800
You dare think

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.120
you can sneak past us?!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.490
You shall not pass!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.490
Here they come.

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:16.760
All units, intercept!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:17.420
Roger!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:18.250
Yes, sir!

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.880
Freyja!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.800
Believe in your song!

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:25.340
Hayate...

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.610
Fre-Fre!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.690
Freyja!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:32.390
Makina... Reina...

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:33.850
Freyja!

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:36.250
Kaname...

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.690
Let's go, Freyja.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:42.980
Right!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:50.740
<i>If you can see the end of the sky</i>

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:56.910
<i>If you can hear my trembling voice</i>

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:02.940
<i>Then rise up like you would explode into pieces</i>

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:09.260
<i>Our torn memories will be our limitless wings</i>

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.360
<i>Remember what we talked about that day?</i>

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:12.420
Hayate?

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.390
<i>Remember how we used to laugh?</i>

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:21.480
<i>We'll just rise up until we can relive the days</i>

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.390
Delta 4! Delta 4!

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:27.100
<i>Break me; feel me closer and stronger</i>

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.730
Cassim Ebelhart!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.440
Hayate Immelmann!

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.950
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:35.250
<i>My life blooms on the battlefield, burning away</i>

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:38.950
<i>Kill me now before I dry up and die</i>

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:40.120
May the true wind blow in my rune!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:42.200
<i>I will flare up my entire existence</i>

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:50.820
<i>And make miracles happen under this suffocating sky</i>

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:49.340
This flight pattern...

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:50.720
Cassim?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.340
Such a sharp wind...

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:59.140
<i>Inside this storm of emotions,</i>

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:04.980
<i>I feel like I'll forget who I really am</i>

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.640
The wind was disrupted?

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.450
Hayate?!

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:11.240
<i>I'm being bombarded by worries and uncertainties</i>

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:06.440
Oh no!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:07.950
He lost control?

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.610
I told you I'd have no mercy!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:17.200
<i>The only way to win is to admit my weakness</i>

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.400
Hayate!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.080
Hayate!

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.790
<i>If it weren't me</i>

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.860
<i>If it weren't you</i>

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:29.920
<i>I don't think we could've ever felt this way</i>

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:27.710
Hayate?

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:29.910
Hayate...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:35.870
<i>Swing your blade into the darkness of justice...</i>

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.860
Hayate...

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.050
Hayate!

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.760
Hayate!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.440
Mirage?

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:44.940
Hayate!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:46.940
Respond, Hayate!

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:50.690
<i>galaxy... if you're still there when I'm there</i>

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:52.840
Hayate! Hayate!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:59.340
<i>We can become invincible together</i>

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.610
Mirage... Freyja...

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:00.450
What was I doing?

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:02.450
Hayate!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:07.170
Thank you, Mirage, Freyja.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.960
You risked your lives for me.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:15.970
<i>Everyone lives every day like a routine</i>

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.920
I'll never lose control again!

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:21.470
<i>I don't want to live meaninglessly</i>

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:21.930
Incoming!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:27.230
<i>I don't want to live like I'm dead</i>

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:25.980
Let's do this, Delta 4!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.230
No need to tell me!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:30.910
<i>I want to bleed and take out my fangs</i>

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.730
Gotcha!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.970
Let's continue where we left off!

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:37.450
<i>That's how you and I know we're alive</i>

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.490
Hayate, formation crossbone!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.780
Got it!

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:45.220
<i>Break me; feel me closer and stronger</i>

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:48.360
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:53.310
<i>My life blooms on the battlefield, burning away</i>

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.870
Finally got over it.

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:57.420
<i>Kill me now before I dry up and die</i>

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.050
Bio-fold waves have reached critical amplitude.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.020
Fold gate opening.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:00.510
<i>I will flare up my entire existence</i>

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:09.100
<i>And make miracles happen under this suffocating sky</i>

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.270
Everyone get on the shuttle!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.220
Damn you, Walküre!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.360
Enemies incoming!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.610
Oh, no you ain't!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.990
Have a taste of jellyfish venom!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.760
First Lt. Chuck!

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.000
Hurry up!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:21.970
Roger!

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:23.750
Get in!

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:31.400
Xao, Cassim! Go after them!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:31.880
Theo!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.020
Appreciated!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.090
Two got through!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:46.600
That mountain...

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:48.480
This snow...

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.700
Yes, this is Windermere!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.570
Outsiders must not taint our winds!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.780
I won't let you fly these skies!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:01.820
Shit!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:03.700
Dodge!

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.220
Kaname! Freyja!

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.010
Fre-Fre!

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:12.830
Freyja!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:13.840
What?!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.130
Hayate!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.640
Hayate?

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.060
The way he's flying...

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.870
You're overdoing it, Cassim!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:36.530
Cassim!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.740
This wind...

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.120
It's like the White Knight—

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.040
Hayate...

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.350
Hey, old man!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.540
What are you doing, Cassim?!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.630
Pull up, Cassim!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:20.570
What?

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.590
If he crashes into the woods, he can survive.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.800
Cassim!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.640
Hayate!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:49.720
Cassim?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.510
What are you doing?!

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.690
You should've crashed into the woodlands!

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:13.160
Cassim...

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:16.960
His rune is running out.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.390
Is the apple orchard doing well?

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.890
Are you...

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:37.500
Alec...

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>The stars are aligning, an occasion once in 30 years</i>

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:24.820
<i>I don't want to sleep, just sitting next to you</i>

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:29.090
<i>and see how things work out</i>

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:38.240
<i>I can feel the wheels turning little by little</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:40.930
<i>(Can you hear my heart?)</i>

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:45.310
<i>A year? A day? A moment?</i>

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:53.570
<i>I've never considered what those even mean</i>

00:22:55.430 --> 00:22:57.030
<i>Don't tell me now</i>

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:04.360
<i>When the falling stars are coming, I don't wanna know</i>

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:07.280
<i>(Hey, I'm alive here and now)</i>

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.750
<i>Don't tell me now</i>

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:16.090
<i>Because I don't want regrets if this is the end</i>

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:18.980
<i>(Hey, we're here right now)</i>

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:28.500
<i>Then the wind starts blowing with no warning</i>

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.770
Mission 22: Extreme Brave

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:39.770
Next time: Scarred Requiem
